  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Installasjon av libunwind</title>

    <para>
      Rett en feil prototype for <envar>malloc()</envar>:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>sed -i '/func.s/s/s//' tests/Gtest-nomalloc.c</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Installer libunwind ved å kjøre følgende 
      kommandoer:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;
make</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Nå, som <systemitem class="username">root</systemitem> bruker:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>lib32 Installasjon av libunwind</title>

    <para>
      Installer lib32-libunwind ved å kjøre følgende 
      kommandoer:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>make clean &amp;&amp;
CC="gcc -m32" CXX="g++ -m32"                     \
PKG_CONFIG_PATH=/usr/lib32/pkgconfig             \
./configure --prefix=/usr                        \
            --libdir=/usr/lib32                  \
            --host=i686-pc-linux-gnu             \
            --disable-static &amp;&amp;

make</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Nå, som <systemitem class="username">root</systemitem> bruker:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make DESTDIR=$PWD/DESTDIR install                      &amp;&amp;
cp -vr DESTDIR/usr/lib32/* /usr/lib32                  &amp;&amp;
cp -v DESTDIR/usr/include/libunwind-x86.h /usr/include &amp;&amp;
rm -rf DESTDIR                                         &amp;&amp;
ldconfig</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="commands">

    <title>Parameterforklaringer</title>

